### Key Design Decisions:

| Milestone | Rule Type | Rationale |
|-----------|-----------|-----------|
| find_gravel | position_near_with_facing | Find/locate task → preferred rule. max_distance=6 prevents trivial satisfaction at spawn (player is ~9.2 blocks away at start). |
| mine_sandstone_wall | inventory_has | Mine task → item ends up in inventory. Clean, unambiguous check. |
| fall_into_pit | position_inside_box | The pit is physically enclosed and ONLY reachable by falling. This makes position_inside_box a valid proxy for "player fell." |
| find_lily_pad | position_near_with_facing | Find/locate task → preferred rule. max_distance=10 with facing check ensures intentional navigation to the pond. |
